option.BLOOM_CLAMP=Bloom Max Brightness
comment.BLOOM_CLAMP=Limits bloom blowout so bright blocks do not wash the scene to white.
comment.LIGHT_DARKNESS=Higher values make caves darker. Lower values reduce harsh light/shadow contrast on blocks.
comment.MIN_LIGHT_LEVEL=Crushes near-black noise to true black. Set to 0 for pitch-black caves; raise slightly if dark areas look too crushed.
comment.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Wide soft bloom applied to the rendered view (screen-space), not block surfaces.
comment.SUB_BLOOM_INTENSITY=Tight screen-space glow around bright pixels in the view.
comment.SUB_BLOOM_RADIUS=How wide the tight view glow spreads in pixels.
comment.BLOCK_LIGHT_RADIUS=How far the main view bloom blurs across the screen.
comment.EMISSION_SURFACE=Brightness of colored light on emitter block texels only (no neighbor spill).
comment.LIGHT_TORCH=Color and brightness for torches and wall torches.
comment.LIGHT_LANTERN=Color and brightness for lanterns.
comment.LIGHT_SOUL=Color and brightness for soul torches and soul fire.
comment.LIGHT_LAVA=Color and brightness for lava and magma blocks.
